  "description": "HuntGlitch is a Logging tool to log the various logs like Debug, Error, Info, Notice, Warnning. This is the .NET Port library for the HuntGlitch which will allow you to use the required method to log the data on the HuntGlitch and also helps you to keep a track of it without worring about the base infrastructure. It will also send email for the specifc log category.",
