  "releaseNotes": "An official .NET Library created for HuntGlitch to log the Errors, Info, Notice, Debug etc. This Package is compatible with all the .NET Core 3.1 and above as well as .NET 5 and above version.Created the base method which you can access in your any .NET Core project without worring about the boilerplate code. Just install the nuget package in your project. Do the required DI and that's it. It's ready to use. Please check the Readme file for more information.",
